Changes made to upstream files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------

No upstream file has been edited. Two were renamed so that this fork could put
its own files in their place, and both are byte-for-byte as upstream shipped
them:

    README.md   -> README.upstream.md
    install.sh  -> install.upstream.sh

The replacements do more than the originals: install.sh also installs the two
front-ends and a config file, and README.md documents the fork. Upstream's
`gopro` script itself is called, not copied or modified -- bin/gopro-cam runs
it as a separate program.
